  "notes": [
    "Fully regular -IR verb; follows standard endings throughout",
    "Past participle: recurrido (regular)",
    "Takes the preposition *a*: *recurrir a alguien/algo* = to turn to someone/something, to resort to something",
    "*Recurrir a un abogado* = to turn to a lawyer; *recurrir a la violencia* = to resort to violence",
    "Also used in legal contexts: *recurrir una sentencia* = to appeal a sentence",
    "Related: el recurso (resource, appeal), los recursos naturales (natural resources)"
  ],
